# VMLens fallback VM inventory.
#
# Copy this file to:
#
#   configs/vms.local
#
# Format v2:
#
#   alias|host|ssh_user|ssh_key|remote_backend|local_backend|proxy_jump|role|type|environment|owner|tenant_id|project_id|region|zone|network_id|subnet_id|public_ip|provider_id|probe_protocol|probe_port|capture_interface|ignore_ports|ignore_ips|flow_allow_cidrs|flow_deny_cidrs|notes
#
# Fields:
#
# - alias: readable name used by scripts and backend/frontend display.
# - host: VM IP/hostname reachable over SSH from local laptop.
# - ssh_user: SSH username, or "-" to use SSH_USER/default ubuntu.
# - ssh_key: SSH key path, "agent"/"none" for SSH config/ssh-agent, or "-" to use SSH_KEY/default key.
# - remote_backend: reverse tunnel listen address inside VM, or "-" to use REMOTE_BACKEND/default 127.0.0.1:18080.
# - local_backend: local dashboard API address, or "-" to use LOCAL_BACKEND/default 127.0.0.1:8080.
# - proxy_jump: optional SSH jump host, or "-" for direct SSH.
# - role/type/environment/owner/tenant_id/project_id/region/zone/network_id/subnet_id/public_ip/provider_id: backend/cloud metadata.
# - probe_protocol/probe_port: connectivity probe target for this VM.
# - capture_interface/ignore_ports/ignore_ips/flow_allow_cidrs/flow_deny_cidrs: agent/network tracking defaults.
# - notes: local operator notes.
#
# One shared key for all VMs is normal if the public key is installed on every VM.
# Per-VM keys are also supported by setting different ssh_key values per row.

testing-a-1|10.20.20.130|-|-|-|-|-|application|virtual_machine|external-vm|platform|local|vmlens-lab|openstack-local|zone-a|production-private-network|app-subnet|-|openstack-vm-testing-a-1|tcp|18081|ens3|18080,18081,18082,30033,30035,8080|10.20.20.125|10.20.20.0/24|10.20.20.125/32|direct from Windows; use proxy_jump if WSL cannot reach it
testing-a-2|10.20.20.199|-|-|-|-|-|bastion|virtual_machine|external-vm|platform|local|vmlens-lab|openstack-local|zone-a|production-private-network|management-subnet|-|openstack-vm-testing-a-2|tcp|18081|ens3|18080,18081,18082,30033,30035,8080|10.20.20.125|10.20.20.0/24|10.20.20.125/32|direct SSH from WSL/Windows
testing-a-3|10.20.20.220|-|-|-|-|-|worker|virtual_machine|external-vm|platform|local|vmlens-lab|openstack-local|zone-a|production-private-network|worker-subnet|-|openstack-vm-testing-a-3|tcp|18081|ens3|18080,18081,18082,30033,30035,8080|10.20.20.125|10.20.20.0/24|10.20.20.125/32|direct SSH from WSL/Windows
